    "logic": "An irregular seven-by-ten source scaffold merges panels around a dark central recess. Raised slabs, triangular hinged flaps, circular cut-through openings and discs share a shallow orthographic paper space. Labels belong to identified surfaces and use the same projection and clipping as their paper. Higher panels occlude both lower geometry and its text. Terraces and seeded collages are explicit layout alternatives.",
